>.</span><span class="token function" style="color: rgb(130, 80, 223);">waitForFunction</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span><span class="token plain">waitForDocusaurusHydration</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">await</span><span class="token plain"> page</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">.</span><span class="token function" style="color: rgb(130, 80, 223);">addStyleTag</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#123;</span><span class="token plain">content</span><span class="token operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">:</span><span class="token plain"> stylesheet</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">await</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token function" style="color: rgb(130, 80, 223);">argosScreenshot</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span><span class="token plain">page</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token function" style="color: rgb(130, 80, 223);">pathnameToArgosName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">(</span